1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,544
You took some tiles.

2
00:00:01,864 --> 00:00:02,994
Where do they go?

3
00:00:03,314 --> 00:00:04,829
Onto your pattern lines.

4
00:00:05,833 --> 00:00:07,796
Look at the left side of Ana's board.

5
00:00:08,115 --> 00:00:11,081
These five lines of spaces are her pattern lines.

6
00:00:12,199 --> 00:00:13,885
Line one has one space.

7
00:00:14,205 --> 00:00:15,997
Line two has two spaces.

8
00:00:16,317 --> 00:00:17,917
And line five has five.

9
00:00:19,033 --> 00:00:21,635
Each line belongs to the wall row beside it.

10
00:00:21,955 --> 00:00:23,342
A row goes across.

11
00:00:25,683 --> 00:00:27,454
Ana takes two blue tiles.

12
00:00:27,774 --> 00:00:30,803
She puts them all in one pattern line: line three.

13
00:00:31,933 --> 00:00:34,152
Tiles fill a line from right to left.

14
00:00:34,472 --> 00:00:36,519
The first tile goes next to the wall.

15
00:00:37,633 --> 00:00:40,108
A pattern line holds one colour only.

16
00:00:40,428 --> 00:00:42,497
Line three is now a blue line.

17
00:00:44,816 --> 00:00:47,056
Later, she takes one more blue tile.

18
00:00:47,376 --> 00:00:48,934
It fills the last space.

19
00:00:49,666 --> 00:00:51,160
Every space is filled.

20
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:53,101
Now the line is complete.

21
00:00:54,233 --> 00:00:55,982
Now look at row two of her wall.

22
00:00:56,302 --> 00:00:58,073
It already has a yellow tile.

23
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,482
So yellow can't go in pattern line two.

24
00:01:01,802 --> 00:01:04,256
A colour can't go where its wall row has it.

25
00:01:06,583 --> 00:01:09,804
Ana puts her two yellow tiles in line five instead.

26
00:01:11,850 --> 00:01:14,004
Next, Ana takes three red tiles.

27
00:01:14,324 --> 00:01:16,863
She picks line two, which has two spaces.

28
00:01:17,966 --> 00:01:19,460
Two tiles fill the line.

29
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:21,998
The extra one falls to the floor line.

30
00:01:22,318 --> 00:01:25,305
The floor line is the seven spaces at the bottom.

31
00:01:26,433 --> 00:01:29,548
You may also put all your tiles straight on the floor line.

32
00:01:30,666 --> 00:01:31,562
Remember.

33
00:01:31,882 --> 00:01:34,016
Fill a pattern line from right to left.

34
00:01:34,335 --> 00:01:38,538
Each line holds one colour, and never a colour already in its wall row.

35
00:01:38,858 --> 00:01:41,034
Extra tiles fall to the floor line.

36
00:01:41,354 --> 00:01:42,912
Next: the floor line.
